---
/**
 * 页面底部的 CG 渐变融合图(用户提供的插画)。
 * 用双向渐隐的 mask 让插图从页面背景中浮现、再化回背景,避免生硬拼贴;
 * 深色模式下轻微压暗。首页、搜索页与英文首页共用。
 */
---

<div class='cg-backdrop' role='presentation' aria-hidden='true'></div>

<style>
  .cg-backdrop {
    margin-inline: calc(50% - 50vw);
    margin-top: 1rem;
    height: clamp(260px, 32vh, 420px);
    background-image: url('/backgrounds/final/cg-home.webp');
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center 55%;
    -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(
      to bottom,
      transparent 0%,
      black 32%,
      black 72%,
      transparent 100%
    );
    mask-image: linear-gradient(
      to bottom,
      transparent 0%,
      black 32%,
      black 72%,
      transparent 100%
    );
  }

  :global(html.dark) .cg-backdrop {
    filter: brightness(0.86) saturate(0.96);
  }
</style>
